          "value": "Like wow! Scooby and the gang face off against some all-time classic villains, including The Witch Doctor, The Black Knight, and The Snow Ghost. Help guide Scooby and the gang through three classic episodes and one all-new episode. It's your job to search for clues and unmask the ghoulish villains!",
