        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed, someone has brought the costumes belonging to Scoobys greatest nemesis to life and now they are threatening all of Coolsville. Join Scooby, Shaggy, Fred and the rest of the Scooby-Doo Gang as they team up to solve the mystery and save Coolsville. During the game you control Scooby, Daphne and the whole Scooby gang as they run, jump and battle their way post scores of frightening creatures. On each level you have specific objectives that you must achieve in addition to collecting Scooby Snacks and other powerups. Scooby-Doo 2 Monsters Unleashed is a single-player action/adventure that utilizes a password feature for marking your progress in the game.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "En Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed, alguien ha dado vida a los disfraces del mayor enemigo de Scooby, y ahora amenazan a todo Coolsville. Únete a Scooby, Shaggy, Fred y el resto de la pandilla de Scooby-Doo, que se unen para resolver el misterio y salvar Coolsville. Durante el juego controlas a Scooby, Daphne y toda la pandilla mientras corren, saltan y luchan para abrirse paso entre decenas de criaturas aterradoras. En cada nivel tienes objetivos específicos que cumplir, además de recoger Scooby Snacks y otros power-ups. Scooby-Doo 2 Monsters Unleashed es una aventura de acción para un jugador que usa un sistema de contraseñas para guardar el progreso.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2004",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
